# What must never be committed here: anything written by a running program or a
# working session. Logs, transcripts, run output and work notes can hold folder
# paths, user and computer names, hardware details and a game's code.
# Put throwaway files in /tmp/ (ignored below). See CLAUDE.md, "Conventions".

# ----- Scratch space -----
/tmp/
/scratch/
/out/
/output/

# ----- Local test games. Bring your own game; never commit one. -----
/test-game/
/test-game-pristine/
/test-games/

# ----- Logs -----
*.log
*.log.*
*.log-*
# Root only: the sidecar has a source folder named Logs, and names match without regard to case on Windows.
/logs/
*.trace
*.dmp
*.mdmp
*.stackdump
npm-debug.log*
bun-debug.log*
# Unity and the mod loader write these inside a game folder and the user profile.
Player.log
Player-prev.log
LogOutput.log
ErrorLog.log
# Unity crash reports
Crashes/
crash.dmp

# ----- Output of agent and benchmark runs -----
transcript.md
transcript.json
transcript*.jsonl
*.transcript.md
*.transcript.json
/transcripts/
/acceptance/
docs/acceptance/
/runs/
run-*.json
benchmark.json
benchmarks.json
benchmark-*.json
*.cassette.local.json

# ----- Work notes and diaries -----
# Notes a person or a coding agent keeps while working belong in the pull
# request or an issue, not in the repository. Lasting design reasons go in
# docs/design-decisions.md.
PROGRESS.md
PROGRESS-*.md
DECISIONS.md
BLOCKED.md
WORKLOG.md
JOURNAL.md
SCRATCH.md
HANDOFF.md
# These names are also used by real documents deeper in the tree, so only the top level is ignored.
/NOTES.md
/STATUS.md
/PLAN.md
/TODO.md
*.local.md
CLAUDE.local.md
AGENTS.local.md

# ----- Local settings, keys and session data -----
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.local.json
*.local.jsonc
local.jsonc
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/projects/
.claude/todos/
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
*.db-journal
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.sqlite-shm
*.sqlite-wal
*.pem
*.key
*.pfx
*.p12

# ----- Screen captures taken while testing -----
# Pictures for the documentation live in docs/screenshots/ and must show no
# real paths, names or games.
/screenshots/
/captures/
*.screenshot.png

# ----- Private backups and repository bundles -----
/private-backups/
*.bundle

# ----- Build output -----
bin/
obj/
*.user
.vs/
TestResults/
/artifacts/
node_modules/

# ----- Blender working files (the icon is rebuilt from branding/make_icon.py) -----
*.blend
*.blend1

# ----- Editor and operating system files -----
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.idea/
*.swp
*~
